              item2_href="#cl-toc-constraints" item2_text="Constraints"
              item3_href="#cl-toc-what-we-did" item3_text="What we did"
              item4_href="#cl-toc-after" item4_text="What happened afterwards"
            }}
            <div id="cl-toc-article" class="mrc-stack mrc-stack--l">
              <h2 id="cl-toc-brief">The brief</h2>
              <p>A fixture article so the TOC has something to point at. On a case-study template this would be the post body.</p>
              <h2 id="cl-toc-constraints">Constraints</h2>
              <p>Seasonal staff, a booking engine that could not be replaced, and a launch date that was already on a brochure.</p>
              <h3 id="cl-toc-what-we-did">What we did</h3>
              <p>Cut the form to three steps, wrote the error messages in plain language, and trained the front desk on the new flow.</p>
              <h2 id="cl-toc-after">What happened afterwards</h2>
              <p>The same season, more confirmed stays, and a comms team that could change dates without a developer.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      {{> "component-library/cl-frame-end"}}

      {{! ========== Edge cases ========== }}
      {{> "component-library/cl-frame-start" id="cl-edge" title="Edge cases — adjacent repeats & inverse grounds" status="draft" notes="Wireframe checklist: repeated adjacent components, inverse backgrounds, awkward density."}}
        <section class="mrc-section section-surface gh-outer">
          <div class="gh-inner">
            <h3 class="mrc-section-heading">Repeated adjacent project cards</h3>
            <div class="mrc-grid mrc-grid--auto mrc-grid--gap-l">
              {{> "common-project-card" title="Card A" accent="olive" item1="One" item2="Two"}}
              {{> "common-project-card" title="Card B" accent="maroon" item1="One" item2="Two"}}
              {{> "common-project-card" title="Card C" accent="olive" item1="One" item2="Two"}}
              {{> "common-project-card" title="Card D" accent="maroon" item1="One" item2="Two"}}
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        {{> "cta-section" headline="CTA immediately after a dense grid" subtext="Checks section rhythm when maroon follows paper without a quiet band." button_text="Get in touch" href="#cl-edge"}}
        {{> "cta-section" bg_class="section-dark" headline="Second CTA in a row (should feel loud)" button_text="Still here" href="#cl-edge"}}
      {{> "component-library/cl-frame-end"}}

    </div>
  </div>
</main>
